  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reactivacin Productiva y Econmica de la Cadena de Valor de Caf de la Unin Majomut</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since the coffee rust crisis of 2012-2013 farmers in the highlands of Chiapas have struggled to increase their incomes and maintain their livelihoods. Unin de Productores Orgnicos Beneficio Majomut Sociedad de Produccin Rural de Responsabilidad Limitada (MAJOMUT) aims to double the incomes of its members by helping improve coffee quality and sales in domestic and international specialty markets. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Mexico. MAJOMUT&apos;s activities promote smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
